 y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"1780\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"2530\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3197\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"4254\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"4754\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> only condition IV is <em>necessary</em> to conclude that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"11.69ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 5033.1 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\\det(A)=0.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-64\" d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H373V44L365 37Q307 -11 235 -11Q158 -11 96 50T34 215Q34 315 97 378T244 442Q319 442 376 393V495ZM373 342Q328 405 260 405Q211 405 173 369Q146 341 139 305T131 211Q131 155 138 120T173 59Q203 26 251 26Q322 26 373 103V342Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-65\" d=\"M28 218Q28 273 48 318T98 391T163 433T229 448Q282 448 320 430T378 380T406 316T415 245Q415 238 408 231H126V216Q126 68 226 36Q246 30 270 30Q312 30 342 62Q359 79 369 104L379 128Q382 131 395 131H398Q415 131 415 121Q415 117 412 108Q393 53 349 21T250 -11Q155 -11 92 58T28 218ZM333 275Q322 403 238 411H236Q228 411 220 410T195 402T166 381T143 340T127 274V267H333V275Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-74\" d=\"M27 422Q80 426 109 478T141 600V615H181V431H316V385H181V241Q182 116 182 100T189 68Q203 29 238 29Q282 29 292 100Q293 108 293 146V181H333V146V134Q333 57 291 17Q264 -10 221 -10Q187 -10 162 2T124 33T105 68T98 100Q97 107 97 248V385H18V422H27Z\"></path>\n<path stroke